# What Docker may copy into the image. Everything is excluded except the files listed with "!",
# so .env (the passwords), the virtual environments, the data and Airflow can never get in,
# even if new files appear in the repository.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/pipelines/pyproject.toml
!packages/pipelines/README.md
!packages/pipelines/src/
!packages/analysis/pyproject.toml
**/__pycache__
